#: templates/core/home.html:13
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"      <p>\n"
"        Welcome to the home of <strong>Shifoo</strong> (previously <i>That "
"Computer Scientist</i>). My name is <a "
"href=\"%(bobby_profile_url)s\">@bobby</a>, and this is my personal website. "
"I aim to build a retro looking personal website, where I share my thoughts, "
"ideas, and experiences through articles, and will showcase some cool "
"nostalgic features and tools.\n"
"      </p>\n"
"      <p>Please note that I am continuously working on this site, and it is "
"still under construction. So, not all features are available yet, and some "
"features may not work as intended.</p>\n"
"      <p>\n"
"        There's also a some of <a href=\"#thegoodstuff\">The Good Stuff</a> "
"you can find in the sidebar, that you can play around with. I will be adding "
"more in the not so distant future. Also, To participate around various "
"sections of the site, you will need to <a "
"href=\"%(register_url)s\">register</a> for an account. I hope you enjoy your "
"stay here.\n"
"      </p>\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    <p>\n"
"      <strong>Shifoo</strong>（以前の<i>That Computer Scientist</i>）のサイト"
"へようこそ。俺は<a href=\"%(bobby_profile_url)s\">@bobby</a>って言って、ここ"
"は俺の個人サイト。レトロな感じの個人サイトを作りたくてさ、ここで俺の考えやア"
"イデア、経験を記事にして共有したり、懐かしくてクールな機能やツールを紹介した"
"りするつもりだよ。\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>ちなみに、このサイトはまだ工事中で常に作業してるから、全部の機能がまだ"
"使えるわけじゃないし、うまく動かない部分もあるかもね。</p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"      サイドバーには<a href=\"#thegoodstuff\">いいもの</a>もあるから、遊んで"
"みてくれよ。近いうちにもっと追加するからな。あと、サイトのいろんな部分に参加"
"するには、アカウントに<a href=\"%(register_url)s\">登録</a>する必要があるよ。"
"ここでの時間を楽しんでくれたら嬉しいな。\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    "

